{"VizWiz_train_00000001.jpg": "<figure type=\"PHOTOGRAPH\">\n\n<description>A high-angle, slightly blurry, close-up photograph taken in a kitchen setting. The image shows a dark granite-patterned countertop in the foreground with a light-colored wooden cabinet door beneath it. On the counter, from left to right: three identical stainless steel cylindrical canisters (labeled 'sugar', 'tea', and 'coffee' or similar, though partially obscured), a black toaster, and a black Coca-Cola Zero can standing upright. Behind the toaster and can, there is a brown ceramic mug or pot. The background wall is white with a standard UK-style double electrical wall socket outlet mounted on it. The lighting appears to be ambient kitchen lighting.</description></figure>\n\n<!-- doc_id=parse-01m0t9t0wxqm3xxrgwke1hag0q -->", "VizWiz_train_00000002.jpg": "<figure type=\"PHOTOGRAPH\">\n\n<description>A close-up photograph of a metal food can containing Price Chopper brand crushed tomatoes. The label is predominantly blue and features a background image of fresh, vine-ripened tomatoes. The text on the label, from top to bottom, reads: 'Price Chopper' (with a logo of a stylized shopping cart), 'Crushed Tomatoes' in a large, bold, serif font inside a dark blue oval, 'in Puree' below the oval, 'Vine Ripened' centered below that, and 'NET WT 28 OZ (1 LB 12 OZ) (794g)' at the bottom edge.</description></figure>\n\n<!-- doc_id=parse-01m0t9t0zpbffc0zx2zz4jewa4 -->", "VizWiz_train_00000000.jpg": "<figure type=\"PHOTOGRAPH\">\n\n<description>A close-up photograph of a clear plastic spice jar containing dried basil leaves. The label on the jar is partially visible at the top, featuring a green graphic of a basil leaf and text.</description> Basil Leaves NET WT 0.62 OZ (17g)</figure>\n\n<!-- doc_id=parse-01m0t9t0z638j0fgft2t9mjj2d -->"}